@3020002 = ~every round~
@3020003 = ~every %amount% rounds~
@3020004 = ~every turn~
@3020005 = ~every %amount% turns~
@3020006 = ~every hour~
@3020007 = ~every %amount% hours~
@3020008 = ~every day~
@3020009 = ~every %amount% days~

